{'symbol': 'A', 'date': '2022-05-27 08:00:00', 'title': 'AGILENT ANNOUNCES COLLABORATION WITH APC ON REAL-TIME PROCESS MONITORING', 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AGILENT TECHNOLOGIES INC. (NYSE: A) TODAY ANNOUNCED A COLLABORATION AGREEMENT WITH APC LTD., IN WHICH THE COMPANIES COMMIT TO WORKING TOWARDS COMBINING THEIR TECHNOLOGIES TO PROVIDE UNIQUE WORKFLOWS TO CUSTOMERS THAT SUPPORT AUTOMATED PROCESS ANALYSIS VIA LIQUID CHROMATOGRAPHY (LC). AGILENT HAS SELECTED TO PARTNER WITH APC, A PROVIDER OF INNOVATIVE SMALL MOLECULE AND LARGE MOLECULE PROCESS DESIGN AND PROCESS DEVELOPMENT SOLUTIONS. BOTH APC AND AGILENT PURSU'}